      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a570cf1b301553d0104bddd|full_name}: I don't think you quite understood what I wrote. I mean when you are looking through your friends list to see who is join-able you have to click on each person just to determine what sort of world they are in. Would be nice if that was filterable so I could see who was just in friends/friends+ worlds instead of clicking about 20 people before finally finding one I can join without having to request.",
