  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-23T02:39:27.467Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If this hasn't been thought of before, is there any plan to implement a filter system for the friends list? Example; Being able to filter who and who isn't in a private world. I think this would be a great quality of life change for many many people.",
